    "Idle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Inactivo" } }
      }
    },
    "Implemented at the byte-stream level: MacTermX pauses sending when the device sends XOFF (0x13) and resumes on XON (0x11); both bytes are stripped from the console/capture. It doesn't touch the RTS/DTR lines — that's what RTS/CTS above is for." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Implementado a nivel de flujo de bytes: MacTermX pausa el envío cuando el dispositivo manda XOFF (0x13) y reanuda con XON (0x11); ambos bytes se eliminan de la consola/captura. No toca las líneas RTS/DTR — para eso está RTS/CTS arriba." } }
      }
    },
