    "XON/XOFF (software)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "XON/XOFF (software)" } }
      }
    },
    "ZMODEM here is a simplified stop-and-wait implementation — reliable, but not the real protocol's streaming/resume behavior. Verified only against a synthetic loopback, not real hardware/lrzsz yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Este ZMODEM es una implementación simplificada de parada-y-espera — confiable, pero no el streaming/reanudación del protocolo real. Solo verificado contra un loopback sintético, aún no contra hardware real ni lrzsz." } }
      }
    }
